### Pre_requisities on the application server ###
1. Git should be installed => sudo apt install git -y
2. Docker should be installed => sudo apt install docker.io -y
3. Start the Docker service => sudo service docker status
4. Set the permissions on /var/run/docker.sock => chmod 777 /var/run/docker.sock
5. Java should be installed => sudo apt install fontconfig openjdk-21-jre -y
6. Webhook URL format => https://<jenkins-user>:<jenkins-api-token>@<jenkins-host>/job/<job-name>/build
7. Set DockerHub creds in jenkins